      "key": "K0171",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 23: from about 14:15 to 16:15 I was at the mill; around 16:09 I passed through Mill Road; from about 16:15 to 17:15 I was at home; around 17:11 I passed through Mill Road; around 17:17 I passed through the square; from about 17:15 to 21:00 I was at the Drover's Rest; around 21:06 I passed through the square; from about 21:15 to 07:15 I was at Mill Road; after that it gets hazy \u2014 I'd had a fair bit to drink.",
      "time": 32534,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
