      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 23: from about 14:15 to 17:00 I was at the clinic; around 17:06 I passed through the square; from about 17:15 to 18:00 I was at home; around 18:07 I passed through the square; from about 18:15 to 22:15 I was at the Drover's Rest; around 22:09 I passed through the square; from about 22:15 to 07:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
