      "text": "On Day 23: from about 14:15 to 16:15 I was at the mill; around 16:14 I passed through Mill Road; around 16:20 I passed through the square; from about 16:30 to 19:15 I was at home; around 19:12 I passed through the square; from about 19:15 to 22:15 I was at the Drover's Rest; around 22:10 I passed through the square; from about 22:15 to 07:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; from about 07:15 to 07:15 I was at the square; after that it gets hazy \u2014 I'd had a fair bit to drink.",
      "time": 32534,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
