      "key": "K0347",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 23: from about 14:15 to 17:15 I was at the workshop; around 17:09 I passed through the square; around 17:15 I passed through Mill Road; from about 17:15 to 18:15 I was at home; around 18:13 I passed through Mill Road; around 18:19 I passed through the square; from about 18:15 to 22:00 I was at the Drover's Rest; around 22:07 I passed through the square; around 22:13 I passed through Mill Road; from about 22:15 to 07:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
      "time": 32534,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
