      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 23: from about 14:15 to 18:00 I was at the grocery; around 18:03 I passed through the square; around 18:09 I passed through Mill Road; from about 18:15 to 19:15 I was at home; around 19:11 I passed through Mill Road; around 19:17 I passed through the square; from about 19:15 to 22:15 I was at the Pryce house; around 22:15 I passed through the square; around 22:21 I passed through Mill Road; from about 22:30 to 07:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
      "time": 32534,
